          "pointer": "/decisions/161/reasoning",
          "value": "MediaDive ingredient 1507 is Yeast Nitrogen Base. J240 explicitly names BD-Difco and uses 1 g; DSMZ 1682 and DSMZ 1837 each use 6.7 g without a manufacturer qualifier. The brand and source-specific amounts do not determine product variant, catalog, or amino-acid/ammonium-sulfate inclusion, and do not establish one shared formulation.",
          "previous_value_present": true,
          "previous_value": "MediaDive1507 is a complex Yeast Nitrogen Base entry used at 1 g in J240 and at 6.7 g in each of DSMZ1682 and DSMZ1837. The original KG case gives no exclusion qualifiers or catalog number. Commercial variants differ by amino acids and ammonium sulfate; the shared base name and concentration cannot decide which formulation all these occurrences used.",
          "changed": true,
          "disposition": "SUPPORTED_BOUNDED_REPORT_ONLY",
          "evidence_basis": "Three full recipes show J240 BD-Difco1g versus unqualified1682/1837 6.7g; neither name nor dose proves variant."
        },
